[0.176, "o", "\r\n  deponent — an AI agent proposes actions; the gate governs each one.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.610, "o", "    ALLOW  write_file       reversible-local-write       # in-sandbox\r\n"]
[0.504, "o", "    BLOCK  run_cmd          destructive-or-out-of-scope  # disposable target\r\n"]
[0.504, "o", "    BLOCK  run_cmd          destructive-or-out-of-scope  # exfil attempt\r\n"]
[0.516, "o", "    BLOCK  delete_database  unknown-tool                 # never seen it\r\n"]
[0.500, "o", "\r\n  every decision is on a tamper-evident sha256 chain:\r\n"]
[0.500, "o", "    ledger.verify()  ->  True   (chain intact (4 entries))\r\n"]
[0.608, "o", "\r\n  now try to forge the record — flip a recorded BLOCK to ALLOW:\r\n"]
[0.534, "o", "    ledger.verify()  ->  False   (entry 1: hash mismatch (tampered))\r\n"]
[0.691, "o", "\r\n  It doesn't answer. It testifies.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.525, "x", "0"]
